WEBVTT

00:11:29.566 --> 00:11:31.280
than it is to change it today.

00:11:31.841 --> 00:11:35.586
But I still believe in a future for myself
full of gleaming sinks

00:11:35.610 --> 00:11:36.975
and busy dishwashers,

00:11:36.999 --> 00:11:38.367
and so we're working on it,

00:11:38.391 --> 00:11:41.620
every day, together, moment to moment,

00:11:41.644 --> 00:11:43.295
one dirty dish at a time.

00:11:44.000 --> 00:11:45.151
Thank you.

00:11:45.175 --> 00:11:50.096
(Applause)